This program was made as a testing ground to use what we learnd so far to create a project around color blidness. 
My program focuses on using a set of colors folks struggle with,
to guide them in the direction of what type of blidness they have. 
Those using the program can reffer to the ishihara test at https://www.colorlitelens.com/ishihara-test.html
I got information about the types of colorblidness from, 
https://www.nei.nih.gov/eye-health-information/eye-conditions-and-diseases/color-blindness/types-color-vision-deficiency
